flowchart TD
    A[Public market data: SPY OHLCV + VIX] --> B[Feature engineering\nreturns, realized volatility, ranges, drawdowns, VIX level/change]
    B --> C[Chronological train / validation / test split]
    C --> D[Train-only scaling + PCA-6]
    D --> E[40-day rolling market window]
    E --> F[Recent temporal anchors\n10 anchors from each window]
    F --> G[Leaky trajectory encoding\nanchor_t = leak * anchor_t + (1-leak) * anchor_{t-1}]
    G --> H[Angle encoding\nPCA components to Ry or Rz-Ry rotations]

    H --> I[6-qubit TFIM QRC reservoir\nfull topology, disorder, transverse field]
    I --> J[Reservoir evolution\n3 Trotter steps per anchor]
    J --> K[Virtual-node trajectory features\n3 virtual nodes per anchor]
    K --> L[Observable readout]
    L --> L1[Z observables]
    L --> L2[X / ZX-style observables]
    L --> L3[ZZ correlators / pair features]
    L1 --> M[Reservoir feature matrix]
    L2 --> M
    L3 --> M

    M --> N[Train-only winsorization + top-k feature selection]
    N --> O[Ridge readout\ntrained on log future realized volatility]
    O --> P[exp transform]
    P --> Q[future_rv_20d forecast]
    Q --> R[Required Track A metrics\nRMSE / QLIKE / Mincer-Zarnowitz]
    Q --> S[Forecast-aware regime layer\nq80 watch / q90 warning / q95 crisis-like]
    S --> T[Stakeholder interpretation\nvolatility-regime transition early warning]

    U[Classical baselines] --> U1[Persistence / naive forecast]
    U --> U2[HAR-like ridge]
    U --> U3[ESN reference reservoir\nn=500, sr=0.9, leak=0.5]
    U1 --> R
    U2 --> R
    U3 --> R
    U3 --> V[Reservoir-computing ceiling\nand diagnostic target]
    V -. identifies gap .-> G
    V -. tail-amplitude / calibration gap .-> N

    W[Phase 3 hardware plan] --> W1[QuEra / Aquila\nprimary analog neutral-atom QRC]
    W --> W2[IonQ\nhigh-connectivity digital QRC comparator]
    W --> W3[IBM / Qiskit\naccessible superconducting benchmark]
    I -. digital QRC path .-> W2
    I -. resource baseline .-> W3
    I -. analog reformulation to Rydberg/Ising .-> W1

    X[Controlled Phase 2 probes] --> X1[initial QRC v0 anchor snapshot]
    X --> X2[full topology + virtual nodes]
    X --> X3[leaky-input trajectory encoding]
    X --> X4[final encoding/readout calibration]
    X1 -.-> I
    X2 -.-> I
    X3 -.-> G
    X4 -.-> N

    classDef data fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#555,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef quantum fill:#e8f0ff,stroke:#2454a6,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef readout fill:#fff4dc,stroke:#9a6b00,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef metrics fill:#eaf7ea,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef baseline fill:#f8eaff,stroke:#7b1fa2,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef hardware fill:#ffecec,stroke:#b71c1c,stroke-width:1.2px;

    class A,B,C,D,E,F,G data;
    class H,I,J,K,L,L1,L2,L3 quantum;
    class M,N,O,P readout;
    class Q,R,S,T metrics;
    class U,U1,U2,U3,V,X,X1,X2,X3,X4 baseline;
    class W,W1,W2,W3 hardware;
